{"reviewId": "271078666_87FafcooZ", "review": {"abstract": "造成资源需求的边际上升，而以前在资源品价格处于低位时供给没有得到充分准备，这带来供需边际变化短期内的不平衡，资源约束启动，价格迅速上升，这一点一旦与资本收益率的下降相契合就会发生经济冲击。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "我认为，是不是可以简单理解为类似21年新能源的火热到冷却清库存。\n或者新技术在发达国家进行并提高生产率（新技术引入初期，肯定会逐步提高生产效率（增加投入）而提高利润）；新兴发展国家开始工业化，也会逐步引入技术并追逐利润。那最开始底层的资源品供给可能刚刚达到发达国家的需求（因为资源品没有利润而没有扩大生产），现在新兴发展国家也产生需求，现有资产品供给不足就会引发价格上升（资源约束）。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "4566-4660", "createTime": 1773710343, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "271078666_87FafcooZ", "userVid": 271078666, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 271078666, "name": "陈焰", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEK19mbjVJrZADIOU1kxmYxw6nDMQddz0Z16tqjPMic1gyBJCaqPDMjEJ3N9ibSQoBzmOvxul71q39eibbcs0cfwfDicrmpsNBLMG3SEo81OHSibY7w/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 20309227, "name": "酱香泡泡马化腾", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0017-n3ROwiZYKB0sHB137TIGR10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "酱香泡泡马化腾", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "那你说的这个情况就说明，还处于技术红利还没有用完得阶段呐，投资就还有很好的收益，不存在衰退的情况。\n所以，我理解，这个地方表述的主语有切换，是发达资本主义国家技术红利已经到了瓶颈，但是引进先进生产力的发展中国家技术红利才刚刚开始，造成资源错配，原材料涨价。\n也就是说，此时那个发达国家处于衰退阶段，而那个发展中国家处于繁荣阶段，同一个时代的世界是割裂的，这比较符合现实。", "reviewId": "271078666_87FafcooZ", "commentId": "271078666_87FafcooZ_c403129279_88Qa48BZR", "userVid": 403129279, "createTime": 1777856596, "author": {"userVid": 403129279, "name": "老书虫", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTIlVukCxvdjwnsCWKwT0nv1ERvicDU6oD7eVfRqe0m9icPVMjPV94hTibIiaeDAyV0KAeVkZrIp2bRYRg/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "老书虫", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241209-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}], "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1777856596}